{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07540","headline":"咏史十一首 二 · 李华","name":"咏史十一首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉皇修雅乐，乘舆临太学。\n三老与五更，天王亲割牲。\n一人调风俗，万国和且平。\n单于骤款塞，武库欲销兵。\n文物此朝盛，君臣何穆清。\n至今壝坛下，如有箫韶声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07540.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07540","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}